{"displayStem":"봉합사의 파단하중은 100 N 이상인 두 조직 지지 모형을 비교한다. 두 모형 모두 4개 지점이 전체 120 N을 지지한다. 각 지점 조직은 45 N을 초과하면 절단된다고 설정했다. 실제 봉합법·개수 권고가 아니다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 작성 교육용 합성자료"},{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 교육용 모식도 · 합성자료","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C04 c04-batch\"><div class=\"evidence C04-vector\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 430\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"자료 49의 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"640\" height=\"430\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><text x=\"75\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\">지점별 하중 (N)</text><path d=\"M75 60L75 290\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M75 290L600 290\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"190.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">40</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"85.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">80</text><rect x=\"125\" y=\"211.25\" width=\"28\" height=\"78.75\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"163\" y=\"263.75\" width=\"28\" height=\"26.25\" fill=\"#aaa\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"155\" y=\"325\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><rect x=\"245\" y=\"211.25\" width=\"28\" height=\"78.75\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"283\" y=\"237.5\" width=\"28\" height=\"52.5\" fill=\"#aaa\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"275\" y=\"325\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><rect x=\"365\" y=\"211.25\" width=\"28\" height=\"78.75\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"403\" y=\"106.25\" width=\"28\" height=\"183.75\" fill=\"#aaa\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"395\" y=\"325\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><rect x=\"485\" y=\"211.25\" width=\"28\" height=\"78.75\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"523\" y=\"237.5\" width=\"28\" height=\"52.5\" fill=\"#aaa\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"515\" y=\"325\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><path d=\"M75 171.875L600 171.875\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"></path><text x=\"600\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">절단 기준 45N</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"365\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">봉합 지점 (번호)</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"400\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">흰 막대: 가 / 회색 막대: 나</text></g></svg></div></div>"]}